  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Roll Out and Institutionalisation of the National Maths Curriculum Reform for Malawi</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The programme will 1) Deliver workbooks and teacher guides already procured, and print and deliver new workbooks/textbooks and teacher guides, 2) Print revised pre-service training curriculum materials and train all public teacher training lecturers (under the leadership of the Ministry of Basic and Secondary Education, the Malawi Institute of Education and the Department for Teacher Education), and provide 3) Technical assistance (TA) for maths reform sustainability and foundational learning systems strengthening.</narrative>
  </description>
